  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Motor Spirit** (2 other sources): The Motor Spirit performance was noted as incomplete by the uploader [1][2]\n- **Gaia** (2 other sources): Cavs performed a drum solo during the Gaia performance [1][2]\n- **Iron Lung** (1 other source): Iron Lung included teases for Straws in the Wind [3]\n- Hot Water included teases for The Dripping Tap and Shagnhai [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Astroturf**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [6]\n- **Hate Dancin'**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [6]\n- **Down the Sink**: back after 43 archived shows (379 days); rare: 10 archived performances [6]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Motor Spirit [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2023-06-07.mc930s** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 113 min [1]\n- **kglw2023-06-07.Burns.Schoeps.MK41.Flac24**: source not stated; 15 songs; 113 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [3]\n- **kglw2023-06-07.SBD**: soundboard; 15 songs; 112 min [2]\n- **kglw2023-06-07**: source not stated; 15 songs; 114 min [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2023-06-07.mc930s**: taped by discocape; transferred by discocape; source: Beyerdynamic mc 930 Cards [1]. Also: Beyerdynamic mc 930s in ORTF, Mogami Gold, Zoom H8 at 24/48, 6 feet back rail [1]\n- **kglw2023-06-07.Burns.Schoeps.MK41.Flac24**: taped by Joe Burns; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: Schoeps MK41's > Actives > BabyNBox > Roland r07 > 24/48 [3]. Also: Schoeps MK41s, BabyNBox, Roland r07, 24/48, 7 feet DFC, SD to FLAC via Audacity [3]\n- **kglw2023-06-07.SBD**: source: SBD [2]\n- **kglw2023-06-07**: taped by JB; source: AKG 414 hyper + Austrian Audio OC18 + Universal Auido SP-1 [4]",
